# The design system is published to GitHub Packages under the heartstampxo org,
# and the package is private, so installs need a token with `read:packages`.
# Supplied by the environment — never commit a literal token here.
# Vercel: add NODE_AUTH_TOKEN as an environment variable for the project.
@heartstampxo:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
